Automated Payment Reminder System Using Zapier
Project Links:
Zapier Workflow: https://agents.zapier.com/copy/fbfecf08-a95a-44f2-ac67-553db6579344
Google Sheets – P-0: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S9JN3F1sPFXBO_2BXQvPJv_Nlb7zlJLMZ0Hvy83yqns/edit?gid=0#gid=0

An automated invoice follow-up solution built with Zapier, Google Sheets, Google Drive, and Gmail to identify outstanding payments, send personalized email reminders, and maintain invoice tracking records.

Project Overview

The Automated Payment Reminder System streamlines the process of monitoring pending invoices and communicating payment reminders to designated recipients. By integrating spreadsheet data with email automation, the workflow reduces repetitive manual work and improves the consistency of payment follow-ups.

The project uses the P-0 Google Sheets spreadsheet as its invoice data source. Zapier retrieves invoice records, evaluates payment statuses, applies conditional rules, sends customized reminder emails, and updates the corresponding spreadsheet records.

Objectives

Automate the identification of invoices with pending payments.

Retrieve invoice information directly from Google Sheets.

Apply conditional logic to select eligible records.

Generate personalized payment reminder emails using dynamic spreadsheet values.

Route reminders according to invoice type and configured recipients.

Update reminder tracking fields after successful email delivery.

Maintain a record of email activity for monitoring and auditing.

Tools and Technologies

